title: "OpenAMRobot documentation: open-source mobile manipulator with a ROS 2 mobile base, lift and two OpenArm 2.0 arms"
abstract: >-
  Documentation of OpenAMRobot by Botshare, an open-source mobile manipulator: a
  ROS 2 mobile base with a lift column and two OpenArm 2.0 arms, with open hardware
  (CERN-OHL-P-2.0), software and firmware (MIT) and documentation (CC BY 4.0).
